Hello, everyone! I'm Mr. Jake. Welcome to Online A two, Book three.

2
00:00:06.184 --> 00:00:09.780
Hi! I'm Sreypich. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:16.180
Unit twenty: A Healthy Mind. In this unit, you will talk about stress and how to look after your mind.

4
00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:17.941
Mind.

5
00:00:18.641 --> 00:00:21.047
Mind means the part of you that thinks and feels.

6
00:00:21.347 --> 00:00:22.940
Reading is good for your mind.

7
00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.816
Your turn. Say: Mind.

8
00:00:28.516 --> 00:00:29.343
Mind.

9
00:00:30.350 --> 00:00:31.374
Stress.

10
00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:35.781
Stress means a feeling of worry because of problems or too much work.

11
00:00:36.081 --> 00:00:37.906
Exams can cause stress.

12
00:00:38.606 --> 00:00:41.154
Your turn. Say: Stress.

13
00:00:43.854 --> 00:00:44.704
Stress.

14
00:00:45.717 --> 00:00:46.613
Relax.

15
00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.708
Relax means to rest and feel calm.

16
00:00:50.008 --> 00:00:51.903
I relax by listening to music.

17
00:00:52.603 --> 00:00:56.010
Your turn. Say: Relax.

18
00:00:58.710 --> 00:00:59.804
Relax.

19
00:01:00.817 --> 00:01:01.423
Talk.

20
00:01:02.123 --> 00:01:03.995
Talk means to speak with someone.

21
00:01:04.295 --> 00:01:05.900
Talk to someone you trust.

22
00:01:06.600 --> 00:01:08.834
Your turn. Say: Talk.

23
00:01:11.534 --> 00:01:12.233
Talk.

24
00:01:13.217 --> 00:01:14.067
Breathe.

25
00:01:14.767 --> 00:01:17.393
Breathe means to take air into your body and let it out.

26
00:01:17.693 --> 00:01:19.646
Breathe in slowly, then breathe out.

27
00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:22.732
Your turn. Say: Breathe.

28
00:01:25.432 --> 00:01:26.154
Breathe.

29
00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:28.302
Exercise.

30
00:01:29.002 --> 00:01:31.791
Exercise means moving your body to stay healthy.

31
00:01:32.091 --> 00:01:34.242
Exercise makes me feel happy.

32
00:01:34.942 --> 00:01:37.304
Your turn. Say: Exercise.

33
00:01:40.004 --> 00:01:41.202
Exercise.

34
00:01:42.217 --> 00:01:43.044
Feelings.

35
00:01:43.744 --> 00:01:47.241
Feelings means emotions like happy, sad or angry.

36
00:01:47.541 --> 00:01:49.459
It's OK to share your feelings.

37
00:01:50.159 --> 00:01:53.241
Your turn. Say: Feelings.

38
00:01:55.941 --> 00:01:56.965
Feelings.

39
00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:58.928
Support.

40
00:01:59.628 --> 00:02:02.127
Support means help and kindness from others.

41
00:02:02.427 --> 00:02:04.333
My family gives me support.

42
00:02:05.033 --> 00:02:07.906
Your turn. Say: Support.

43
00:02:10.606 --> 00:02:11.631
Support.

44
00:02:12.617 --> 00:02:14.512
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:14.812 --> 00:02:17.392
Sreypich, what do you do when you feel stressed?

46
00:02:18.683 --> 00:02:21.136
When I feel stressed, I breathe slowly.

47
00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:24.696
That's a good idea. What else?

48
00:02:25.983 --> 00:02:28.238
When I feel sad, I talk to my mum.

49
00:02:29.550 --> 00:02:31.074
And when you feel tired?

50
00:02:32.383 --> 00:02:36.171
When I feel tired, I go for a walk or relax with music.

51
00:02:37.483 --> 00:02:40.121
Grammar focus: When I feel, I.

52
00:02:40.421 --> 00:02:42.595
When I feel stressed, I breathe slowly.

53
00:02:42.895 --> 00:02:46.288
Use the present simple in both parts to talk about your habits.

54
00:02:47.283 --> 00:02:50.029
Now read and listen. Looking After My Mind.

55
00:02:50.329 --> 00:02:52.700
Our minds need care, just like our bodies.

56
00:02:53.983 --> 00:02:57.388
When I feel stressed before exams, I take deep breaths.

57
00:02:58.683 --> 00:03:02.320
When I feel sad, I talk to my family because they give me support.

58
00:03:03.617 --> 00:03:06.220
Exercise also helps me feel calm and happy.

59
00:03:07.517 --> 00:03:10.108
It's important to share our feelings and ask for help.

60
00:03:11.417 --> 00:03:14.127
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:17.158
When I feel sad, I blank to my friend.

62
00:03:17.458 --> 00:03:20.229
A, talk. B, talked. C, talking.

63
00:03:24.217 --> 00:03:26.181
The answer is A: talk.

64
00:03:27.683 --> 00:03:30.554
A feeling of worry because of too much work is blank.

65
00:03:30.854 --> 00:03:34.588
A, stress. B, support. C, exercise.

66
00:03:38.583 --> 00:03:40.920
The answer is A: stress.

67
00:03:42.417 --> 00:03:44.405
To rest and feel calm is to blank.

68
00:03:44.705 --> 00:03:47.812
A, relax. B, breathe. C, talk.

69
00:03:51.817 --> 00:03:54.060
The answer is A: relax.

70
00:03:55.550 --> 00:03:59.131
Now it's your turn to speak. What do you do when you feel stressed?

71
00:04:04.431 --> 00:04:09.684
When I feel stressed, I breathe slowly and listen to music. When I feel sad, I talk to my mum.

72
00:04:09.984 --> 00:04:12.576
Excellent answer, Sreypich!

73
00:04:13.583 --> 00:04:18.105
Great work today! You learned eight new words and when i feel, i.

74
00:04:18.405 --> 00:04:22.961
Today's value is self-care. Look after yourself and rest when you are sick.

75
00:04:23.261 --> 00:04:26.181
See you in Unit twenty-one. Goodbye!

76
00:04:26.481 --> 00:04:29.156
Thank you, Mr. Jake! Bye, everyone!

